/* Usage descriptions for the app target (#990).

   These live here rather than only in project.yml because a usage description
   is the sentence that decides whether someone grants a permission, and iOS
   reads it from the bundle's localisation — not from the app's own `t()`
   tables, which the system dialog knows nothing about.

   The English text must stay identical to the value
   `integrate-share-extension.py` writes into the target's Info.plist: that
   value is the fallback for every language without a .lproj here. */
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "Notesage records meetings and voice notes you start yourself. Recordings stay in your library.";
